H["Practice brokerage and transitions"] = "A once-in-a-career transaction for the seller, so the content job is explaining valuation and process long before the sale."
H["Medical education and training"] = "Continuing education requirements create predictable annual demand tied to licensing cycles."
H["Healthcare non-profits"] = "Donor acquisition and service awareness compete for budget, and grant restrictions often limit what can be spent on either."
H["Healthcare consulting firms"] = "Sold on named partner expertise, so individual consultant profiles outperform firm capability pages."

